  <Docs>
    <summary>A point within the progress bar, defining its position and color.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>A point within the progress bar, defining its position and color. Points within a progress bar are used to visualize distinct stages or milestones. For example, you might use points to mark stops in a multi-stop navigation journey, where each point represents a destination.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Notification.ProgressStyle.Point" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.Notification.ProgressStyle.Point</code>.</a></format></para>
